I wake up early every morning.
I get up from my bed.
I go into my kitchen.
I make a cup of coffee for myself.
The coffee is very hot.
I go near my window.
I look outside.
The sun is coming up.
My neighbourhood is waking up.
Outside, people are walking on the road.
A dog is barking.
Some people are going to work.
I am watching them.
The morning breeze is a little cool.
I am drinking my hot coffee comfortably.
The taste of the coffee is very good.
I like this quiet time a lot.
Now my new day is beginning.
